Intent: TTL expiry compared with < instead of <=, so a grant is still spendable at the exact instant it expires
Property: Approval TTL fails closed at expiry: 'Replay, expiry ... fail closed' (approval.py module docstring); ADR-0001 item 3
--- a/pep/approval.py
+++ b/pep/approval.py
@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@
         return state_matches(self.state_digest, observed_state_digest)
 
     def expired(self, now: datetime) -> bool:
-        return self.expires_at <= now
+        return self.expires_at < now
 
     def consumed(self) -> bool:
         return self.consumed_at is not None
